EYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"_JNRKX9qdBTHLKtAl7dbWg","review_id":"q0L9xEge__bkMIWDjchuAw","date":"2021-11-21T13:14:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9447052478790283,"text_excerpt":"I've been wanting to try this place for a minute and I'm glad I finally did. I came with my niece who also enjoys a good smoothie bowl. When we walked in it was very modern and there were live plants everywhere. While I'm like I was just admiring how great their plants look and getting some ideas for plant stands lol. The names for the items on the menu are cute. Very New Orleans. If you know you know. My niece and I both got \"Dat Fiya Pitaya\" bowl. She said she wanted a tropical vibe so she ordered hers with strawberries, blueberries, and kiwis. I got mine with strawberries, almond butter. And vegan chocolate chips. We were going to take it to go but it was a really nice day out and we s..."},{"business_id":"_JNRKX9qdBTHLKtAl7dbWg","review_id":"brVP7i3sq5VQUXeHpuCXqA","date":"2021-08-25T00:43:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9292675256729126,"text_excerpt":"Great vegan/healthy eatery. They have everything from smoothies, smoothie bowls, coffee, sea moss, vegan cupcakes and much more. This place has great customer service and the perfect ambiance to enjoy your treats, indoor and outdoor seating. The staff is very helpful and friendly. I have tried all the smoothie bowls but my favorite one is Dat Fiya Pitaya (pitaya, banana, pineapple, almond milk, seas moss complete with whatever toppings I pick). This is a a great place and I love that it's black owned! Great location a NOLA must try. Also, love that they have a point reward system."},{"business_id":"_JNRKX9qdBTHLKtAl7dbWg","review_id":"lf2iz3YCJxT8exuCUfIUyw","date":"2021-02-23T19:34:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9268068075180054,"text_excerpt":"This place is an entire VIBE y'all. I took a quick lunch break to try them out and it was totally worth it. I ordered the \"Yeah with the Yeah\" smoothie in 12oz ($7.95) and the Almond Berry toast (1 slice/$3.95). My only complaint is I should have ordered the 16oz smoothie because it was so delicious. The sea moss doesn't have an after taste and the fruit flavor combinations were spot on. The toast was delicious. Thick nutty bread covered in almond butter, mixed berries, agave and coconut flakes. So why you ask the 4 stars and not 5? Well they are a newly opened business so all the menu items weren't available yet. There was only two cold pressed juice options available out of the 7-8 choi..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"_JNRKX9qdBTHLKtAl7dbWg","photo_id":"_H__SPln8CKBCP6cW5G0Yg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_H__SPln8CKBCP6cW5G0Yg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9057088494300842},{"business_id":"_JNRKX9qdBTHLKtAl7dbWg","photo_id":"xXwUWhJrhQ9aBhbNKvU2fQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/xXwUWhJrhQ9aBhbNKvU2fQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8769953846931458},{"business_id":"_JNRKX9qdBTHLKtAl7dbWg","photo_id":"gwz0PPckSYlxdCaLyv74-g","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/gwz0PPckSYlxdCaLyv74-g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8596220016479492},{"business_id":"_JNRKX9qdBTHLKtAl7dbWg","photo_id":"UpBOhlH940xQx2MVouS_0w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/UpBOhlH940xQx2MVouS_0w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.847711563